# Keep line endings identical on every machine.
#
# Git's core.autocrlf is commonly enabled on Windows, which rewrites LF to
# CRLF on checkout. For this repo that is not cosmetic: corpora and
# tokenizer inputs feed a BPE, so an extra carriage return per line changes
# the token stream and makes perplexities incomparable across machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts: never translate, never diff as text.
*.bin  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
